<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>KYC Verification Approved - NestHive</title>
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f7fb;
        color: #1f2937;
        line-height: 1.6;
        padding: 40px 16px;
      }
      .email-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .email-container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #111827;
        padding: 30px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .logo {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }
      .logo span {
        color: #6366f1;
      }
      .hero {
        padding: 40px 32px 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .badge-icon {
        width: 68px;
        height: 68px;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
        background-color: #ecfdf5;
        color: #10b981;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: bold;
        border: 2px solid #a7f3d0;
      }
      .title {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .subtitle {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #6b7280;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px 32px 35px;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #374151;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .message {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #4b5563;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .feature-box {
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }
      .feature-title {
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .feature-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .feature-item {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #4b5563;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .feature-item span {
        color: #10b981;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-right: 8px;
      }
      .btn-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      .btn {
        background-color: #6366f1;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .footer {
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        background-color: #fafafa;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .footer p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
      <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
          <div class="logo">Nest<span>Hive</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero">
          <div class="badge-icon">&#10003;</div>
          <h1 class="title">KYC Verification Approved!</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Your owner profile is now fully verified and activated.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
          <p class="greeting">Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
          <p class="message">
            Great news! Our administrative team has reviewed and successfully approved your KYC verification documents. You now have full access to all landlord & owner features on NestHive.
          </p>

          <div class="feature-box">
            <div class="feature-title">What you can do now:</div>
            <ul class="feature-list">
              <li class="feature-item"><span>&#10003;</span> Publish properties and manage room listings</li>
              <li class="feature-item"><span>&#10003;</span> Receive and review tenant viewing & booking requests</li>
              <li class="feature-item"><span>&#10003;</span> Manage active leases and utility bill splits</li>
              <li class="feature-item"><span>&#10003;</span> Receive secure rent and deposit payments</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <% if (typeof dashboardUrl !== 'undefined' && dashboardUrl) { %>
          <div class="btn-wrapper">
            <a href="<%= dashboardUrl %>" class="btn" target="_blank">Go to Owner Dashboard</a>
          </div>
          <% } %>

          <p class="message" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
            If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to contact our support team.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
          <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> NestHive. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
